{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is a simple 2D platformer adventure game where you play as a duck named Scruffles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains 10 unique levels with increasing difficulty and length (and their own easter eggs).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished Player Movement</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Duck has polished player movement that makes it fun to play whether you have never played a platformer game or if you are an experienced player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash can be played at any pace, whether fast or slow.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains a speedrunning mode so you can see the time it took for you to complete a level.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Xbox Controller Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is fully playable with an Xbox controller.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also, Scruffles is cute)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961540?t=1756262527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961540/a32815af54aefc36d95b95a14be6114ecdeb65ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756262527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961540/f41911542824337f3c7ef6a69eec7f3a3641f1e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756262527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961540/f41911542824337f3c7ef6a69eec7f3a3641f1e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756262527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is a simple 2D platformer adventure game where you play as a duck named Scruffles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains 10 unique levels with increasing difficulty and length (and their own easter eggs).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished Player Movement</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Duck has polished player movement that makes it fun to play whether you have never played a platformer game or if you are an experienced player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash can be played at any pace, whether fast or slow.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash contains a speedrunning mode so you can see the time it took for you to complete a level.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Xbox Controller Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck Dash is fully playable with an Xbox controller.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Also, Scruffles is cute)</p>","developers":["Levi Soren","Julian Cloward"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961540/289641d92aa1221818f6fdb082c4512573761551/header.jpg?t=1756262527","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"m